### Criar matéria
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Matemática"
}

### Criar matéri — História
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Matemática Aplicada"
}

### Listar matérias
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects

### Consultar matéria por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/1

### Atualizar matéria
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Matemática Avançada"
}

### Excluir matéria
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/1

### Teste — Nome vazio (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### Teste — Apenas espaços (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}

### Teste — Nome ausente (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Teste — Atualização inválida (400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### Teste — Cadastro válido (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Física"
}

### Criar tópicos dae matéria
POST http://localhost:8080/api/topics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Álgebra Linear"
}

### Listar tópicos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/topics

### Consultar tópico
GET http://localhost:8080/api/topics/1

### Atualizar tópico
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/topics/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Álgebra Linear Aplicada"
}

### Excluir tópico
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/topics/1